<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-23T07:47:20.153Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta reinstated the death penalty and secured pilot training from a Czech state firm, while its army and Russia's Africa Corps committed new abuses against civilians. In northern Niger gunmen attacked buses, killing at least 12 people. In Mali Islamic State militants killed at least 48 civilians in Ménaka and separate gunmen attacks killed over 40 civilians, and a court in Mopti tried 69 soldiers for alleged crimes. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPRDhKTTlnTVFYd3l3M3VlTHNiMXNwNE9GdkRBeGg1ZXk2eUVnRUl2c3V3Z1ZrZTk2djJLeGhIb3A1NlpTeWs2UWFtYkdhLXJjUS1aTVBfcHE2eGFwR21YdDhBOTlUVXpyb3pnX0xGRkpXaDNCM2c2LTJsNDVlaXFDUy14SWItaW5jOVBabDZZMF82em5oN2hHaFU4Vm90Tm5oVGV4ZVUzUkxLc0l0b2xTVUphUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOWHE0UF9DcDdYdGd5VUN0Q0VQcEZPYWJRTFpJNUhjemx2dWg4VlR6TWRxb0xiX3pHRWxYcU83dk1vQzlRdXdrYmJRZEc4VmxUTXphd19xdWJoZzhrN0t0Nk1EU1dvSThEWHFxLXdYMUNueVZqSzFwcjlHYVBneU1IY2R5RU50TlVIZTUwUXBsb0c4NXdMdlpQOE9LMWw0TWdPY3hpN2NibHg4QWZKZmxSdEs3UDBVdnEx?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVHQtUFdNcFJJZzMyNFdmM3RPTkdWQmVxYy1Cd3E1Z0NXMkNJSEZDVXUyOW9yY1luWlpXUG11cnhsWEhwV0w3ZGo0M1BaSFZoSEJMcExGVnJmMnFzRHl4UVhyXzZ1aDNrcFUtSklISDB0V29Hay16SWtBTTl5d0xFSGpiYXd1M00ydGlkb2dFeDB4SEpraDlWVFZ4RWp6dw?oc=5&q